        "h": "Patrick Stewart dies at 86",
        "p": "Patrick Stewart died on October 28 at his home in Los Angeles, his family said in a statement posted to his Instagram account. He was 86. His horror roles included Dr. Armstrong in Tobe Hooper&rsquo;s <em>Lifeforce</em> (1985) and Darcy Banker in Jeremy Saulnier&rsquo;s <em>Green Room</em> (2015).",
